{
  "slug": "kauri",
  "name": "Kauri",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deterministic decision records for agents and humans. Local-first + team support. Supports both project-level and user-level scopes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `check-staleness` (Check if recorded Kauri decisions are stale), `consult` (Consult existing Kauri decisions before planning or implementing changes), `propose` (Draft a Kauri decision for human review before recording it), `record-decision` (Record a project decision using Kauri), `review` (Review recent code changes against Kauri decisions)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `kauri`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install kauri@claude-community` from `mhashim6/kauri` (`plugins/claude-code`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
